 {"key":"tools_hub","data":{"crm": {"heading": "CRM Software", "benefits": ["Respond to new leads in minutes, not days", "A more personal, consistent customer experience", "Higher conversion from disciplined follow-up", "More productive teams with far less manual tracking", "All customer data centralised, secure and searchable", "Confident decisions backed by real-time reporting"], "features": [{"desc": "Capture leads from your website, ads, WhatsApp and calls into one inbox — auto-assigned and prioritised so none are missed.", "title": "Lead Management"}, {"desc": "A complete, searchable profile for every customer — details, history and notes organised in one place.", "title": "Contact Management"}, {"desc": "A visual, drag-and-drop pipeline that shows which deals are hot and exactly what to do next.", "title": "Sales Pipeline Tracking"}, {"desc": "Automated reminders, emails and WhatsApp sequences so every lead is followed up on time, every time.", "title": "Follow-Up Automation"}, {"desc": "Every call, email and message logged against the contact — full context the moment you open it.", "title": "Customer Communication History"}, {"desc": "Shared notes, clear ownership and clean handoffs that keep sales and support on the same page.", "title": "Team Collaboration"}, {"desc": "Trigger tasks, hand-offs and notifications automatically as deals progress.", "title": "Workflow Automation"}, {"desc": "Real-time dashboards on leads, conversion rates and revenue so decisions are backed by data.", "title": "Reporting & Analytics"}], "workflow": ["Lead Capture", "Lead Qualification", "Follow-Up Automation", "Sales Pipeline", "Deal Closure", "Customer Retention"], "overviewHtml": "<p>Our CRM software gives your business one organised home for every lead, contact and conversation — so nothing slips through the cracks. Capture enquiries from any channel, automate follow-ups, move deals through a visual pipeline, and see exactly where your revenue comes from.</p>"}, "cta": {"text": "Get in touch and we will map the right automation tools to your goals — from CRM and lead management to AI and workflow automation.", "heading": "Ready to automate your business?", "buttonHref": "/#contact", "buttonLabel": "Contact Us"}, "seo": {"ogTitle": "JHB Automation Tools — Business Automation Hub", "metaTitle": "JHB Automation Tools — CRM, Lead Management & Workflow Automation", "ogDescription": "CRM, lead management, marketing, WhatsApp, workflow and AI automation tools to centralise customers, automate follow-ups and grow your business.", "metaDescription": "Explore JHB Automation Tools: CRM software, lead management, marketing and WhatsApp automation, AI business tools and workflow automation — one hub to centralise customers, automate follow-ups and grow."}, "faqs": [{"answer": "A CRM (Customer Relationship Management) system is a single place to store every lead, customer and conversation. It helps you respond faster, follow up consistently and see your whole sales pipeline — so you close more deals with less manual work.", "question": "What is CRM software and how does it help my business?"}, {"answer": "Yes. It is simple enough for small teams yet powerful enough to scale. Start with lead and contact management, then add automation, reporting and integrations as you grow.", "question": "Is this CRM suitable for small and growing businesses?"}, {"answer": "Absolutely. Enquiries from website forms, ad campaigns, WhatsApp and calls flow straight into the CRM, where they are automatically assigned and prioritised so nothing is missed.", "question": "Can it capture leads from my website, ads and WhatsApp automatically?"}, {"answer": "Yes. You can set up automated reminders, emails and WhatsApp sequences that follow up with leads on schedule, keeping every prospect engaged without manual effort.", "question": "Does the CRM automate follow-ups?"}, {"answer": "Every deal moves through a visual, drag-and-drop pipeline. You can see which opportunities are hot, what stage each is in and what action is needed next, at a glance.", "question": "Can I track deals through a sales pipeline?"}, {"answer": "Yes. Shared records, notes, task assignments and clear ownership keep sales and support aligned, with a full history of every interaction available to the team.", "question": "Will my whole team be able to collaborate in the tools?"}, {"answer": "We offer integration services to connect the CRM and automation tools with your website, email, WhatsApp, calendars and other business tools, so your data stays in sync.", "question": "Can the tools integrate with what I already use?"}, {"answer": "Your data is centralised and protected with secure, role-based access. Information is backed up and only available to the team members you authorise.", "question": "Is my customer data safe and secure?"}, {"answer": "Most businesses are up and running quickly. We handle implementation, import your existing contacts, configure your pipeline and automations, and train your team. Timelines depend on the complexity of your workflows.", "question": "How long does it take to set up?"}, {"answer": "Yes. We provide hands-on onboarding, custom workflow setup and ongoing support so your team gets full value from the tools as your business evolves.", "question": "Do you provide training and ongoing support?"}], "hero": {"badge": "Automation Tools Hub", "image": null, "ctaHref": "/#contact", "heading": "Every automation tool your business needs,", "ctaLabel": "Contact Us", "highlight": "in one place", "description": "<a href=\\"https://www.youtube.com/\\">JHB </a>&nbsp;Tools brings your leads, customers, marketing and workflows together — so you can capture every opportunity, automate the busywork, and grow without the manual grind. Explore our suite of business automation solutions below."}, "benefits": [{"desc": "One secure source of truth for every lead, customer and conversation.", "title": "Centralised Customer Data"}, {"desc": "Never lose a lead to a missed follow-up again — the system handles it.", "title": "Automated Follow-Ups"}, {"desc": "See every deal and its stage at a glance, in real time.", "title": "Sales Pipeline Visibility"}, {"desc": "Cut hours of manual admin so your team focuses on closing.", "title": "Higher Productivity"}, {"desc": "Faster, more personal communication backed by full history.", "title": "Better Customer Relationships"}, {"desc": "Automation that grows with you — add tools as your needs evolve.", "title": "Scalable Business Growth"}], "categories": [{"id": "crm", "desc": "Centralise leads, contacts and deals — and automate every follow-up.", "icon": "crm", "image": null, "title": "CRM Software"}, {"id": "lead-management", "desc": "Capture, score and route leads from every channel automatically.", "icon": "flow", "image": null, "title": "Lead Management Tools"}, {"id": "marketing-automation", "desc": "Email, ads and campaigns that nurture prospects on autopilot.", "icon": "rocket", "image": null, "title": "Marketing Automation Tools"}, {"id": "whatsapp-automation", "desc": "Instant, personal WhatsApp replies and follow-up sequences.", "icon": "chat", "image": null, "title": "WhatsApp Automation Tools"}, {"id": "workflow-automation", "desc": "Connect your apps and remove repetitive manual steps.", "icon": "settings", "image": null, "title": "Workflow Automation Tools"}, {"id": "ai-business", "desc": "AI assistants, chatbots and insights that work around the clock.", "icon": "spark", "image": null, "title": "AI Business Tools"}, {"id": "future-tools", "desc": "New automation solutions added as your business scales.", "icon": "app", "image": null, "title": "Future Tools"}]},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T09:23:09.185+00:00","updated_by":"b3fa86c2-511d-4383-b6ab-07c41ce0e8c8"}, 
 {"key":"products","data":{"items": [{"id": "jhb-automation-tools", "faqs": [], "href": "/jhb-automation-tools", "slug": "jhb-automation-tools", "about": {"image": null, "stats": [], "ctaText": "", "enabled": false, "ogImage": "", "ogTitle": "", "benefits": [], "features": [], "imageAlt": "", "overview": "", "canonical": "", "heroTitle": "", "metaTitle": "", "ctaHeading": "", "ctaButtonHref": "/#contact", "ogDescription": "", "ctaButtonLabel": "Book a Free Demo", "heroDescription": "", "metaDescription": ""}, "image": null, "title": "JHB Automation Tools", "status": "published", "ogImage": "", "ogTitle": "JHB Automation Tools — Business Automation Hub", "pricing": [], "imageAlt": "", "overview": "", "sections": [], "canonical": "", "highlight": "", "metaTitle": "JHB Automation Tools — CRM, Lead Management & Workflow Automation", "sortOrder": 0, "description": "CRM, lead management, marketing, WhatsApp, workflow and AI automation tools — one hub to centralise customers, automate follow-ups and grow.", "ogDescription": "CRM, lead management, marketing, WhatsApp, workflow and AI automation tools to grow your business.", "metaDescription": "Explore JHB Automation Tools: CRM software, lead management, marketing, WhatsApp and workflow automation, and AI business tools."}, {"id": "vasool-app", "faqs": [{"answer": "Vasool App is a loan management and field-collection platform that helps lenders issue loans, schedule repayments, dispatch agents with GPS tracking, and reconcile collections in real time — all from one app.", "question": "What is Vasool App?"}, {"answer": "It''s built for finance companies, NBFCs, chit funds, micro-lenders and anyone running daily, weekly or monthly loan collections with a field team.", "question": "Who is Vasool App for?"}, {"answer": "Yes. Agents can record collections and generate receipts with no internet; the data syncs automatically the moment they''re back online.", "question": "Does it work offline?"}, {"answer": "Yes. You can see every agent''s live location, verify each visit with a geo-stamp, replay route history and set geo-fencing alerts.", "question": "Can I track my field agents live?"}, {"answer": "Daily, weekly and monthly EMI loans, plus gold, personal and business loans — each with automatic repayment schedules, interest and penalties.", "question": "What loan types are supported?"}, {"answer": "Yes. The app generates a digital receipt for every payment, instantly shareable via SMS or WhatsApp.", "question": "Can borrowers get receipts?"}, {"answer": "Commissions and incentives are auto-calculated on collected amounts, so payouts are accurate and transparent.", "question": "How are agent commissions handled?"}, {"answer": "Every report — collections, overdue, agent performance, daily cash — can be exported to Excel or PDF for accounting and audits.", "question": "Can I export reports for accounting?"}], "href": "", "slug": "vasool-app", "about": {"image": "/vasool-logo.png", "stats": [{"label": "Faster Follow-Up", "value": "3x"}, {"label": "On-Time Recovery", "value": "+30%"}, {"label": "GPS-Verified Visits", "value": "100%"}, {"label": "Offline-Ready", "value": "24/7"}], "ctaText": "Book a free, no-obligation demo and we''ll show you how Vasool App fits the way your lending business already works.", "enabled": true, "ogImage": "", "ogTitle": "About Vasool App", "benefits": [{"desc": "Disciplined, automated follow-ups lift on-time recovery and shrink overdue accounts.", "title": "Recover More"}, {"desc": "See live agent locations, daily cash and at-risk loans without chasing anyone.", "title": "Total Visibility"}, {"desc": "Auto-generated schedules, receipts and reports replace hours of paperwork.", "title": "Less Manual Work"}, {"desc": "Real-time analytics show exactly where to focus your team next.", "title": "Confident Decisions"}], "features": [{"desc": "Designed around how agents actually work — fast entry, digital receipts and full offline support.", "title": "Built for the Field"}, {"desc": "Every collection is GPS-verified and timestamped, so cash and visits are always traceable.", "title": "Accountable by Design"}, {"desc": "From a three-person team to hundreds of agents across branches, on the same platform.", "title": "Made to Scale"}, {"desc": "Supports daily, weekly and monthly lending models common across Indian markets.", "title": "Local-Friendly"}], "imageAlt": "Vasool Tamil Brand Logo", "overview": "Lenders<span style=\\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-family: Nunito, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, serif; font-size: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\"> துகள்</span>&nbsp;lose money not because borrowers won''t pay, but because follow-ups slip, cash goes unrecorded and managers can''t see what''s happening in the field. We created Vasool App to close that gap. It gives finance companies, NBFCs, chit funds and micro-lenders a single source of truth for every loan, every agent and every rupee collected — with the live visibility and automation needed to recover more, faster, and with full accountability.", "canonical": "", "heroTitle": "About Vasool App", "metaTitle": "About Vasool App — Loan Collection Software Built for Field Teams", "ctaHeading": "See Vasool App in action", "ctaButtonHref": "/#contact", "ogDescription": "Why Vasool App exists, how it works and the results it drives for lending businesses.", "ctaButtonLabel": "Book a Free Demo", "heroDescription": "Vasool App was built to take the chaos out of lending and collections — replacing paper registers and untraceable cash with one clear, accountable system that field teams actually enjoy using.", "metaDescription": "Learn how Vasool App helps lenders, NBFCs and chit funds recover more with GPS-verified collections, automated follow-ups and real-time visibility into every loan and agent."}, "image": null, "title": "Vasool App", "status": "published", "ogImage": "", "ogTitle": "Vasool App — Loan Collection Management, Simplified", "pricing": [{"name": "Starter", "price": "₹1,999", "period": "/month", "ctaHref": "/#contact", "ctaLabel": "Book a Demo", "features": ["Up to 3 agents", "Loan & customer management", "Collection scheduling", "Digital receipts", "Basic reports", "Email support"], "highlighted": false}, {"name": "Growth", "price": "₹4,999", "period": "/month", "ctaHref": "/#contact", "ctaLabel": "Book a Demo", "features": ["Up to 15 agents", "Everything in Starter", "Live GPS tracking", "Route planning", "Agent performance & commissions", "Advanced reports & exports", "Priority support"], "highlighted": true}, {"name": "Enterprise", "price": "Custom", "period": "", "ctaHref": "/#contact", "ctaLabel": "Contact Sales", "features": ["Unlimited agents", "Everything in Growth", "Custom loan products", "API & integrations", "Dedicated onboarding", "Custom reports", "Dedicated account manager"], "highlighted": false}], "imageAlt": "Vasool App — loan collection management", "overview": "&nbsp;management and collection platform built for finance companies, NBFCs, chit funds and micro-lenders. Digitise your entire lending cycle — from issuing loans and scheduling repayments to dispatching field agents, verifying visits with GPS, and reconciling collections instantly. No more paper registers, missed follow-ups or untraceable cash. Everything your collection team needs, in one app that works even offline.", "sections": [{"items": [{"desc": "Issue, track and close loans with full repayment schedules and balances.", "title": "Loan Management"}, {"desc": "A complete, searchable profile for every borrower — KYC, history and notes.", "title": "Customer Database"}, {"desc": "Auto-generated daily collection lists assigned to the right agent.", "title": "Collection Scheduling"}, {"desc": "Record cash, UPI and bank payments with instant balance updates.", "title": "Payment Tracking"}, {"desc": "Generate and share receipts on the spot via SMS or WhatsApp.", "title": "Digital Receipts"}, {"desc": "Agents keep collecting with no signal — data syncs automatically when back online.", "title": "Offline Mode"}], "title": "Features", "subtitle": "Everything you need to manage lending and collections end to end."}, {"items": [{"desc": "High-frequency daily-repayment loans for street and market lending.", "title": "Daily Loans"}, {"desc": "Flexible weekly EMIs with automatic schedule generation.", "title": "Weekly Loans"}, {"desc": "Standard monthly EMI loans with interest and penalty handling.", "title": "Monthly Loans"}, {"desc": "Secured gold-backed loans with valuation and pledge tracking.", "title": "Gold Loans"}, {"desc": "Unsecured personal lending with custom tenures.", "title": "Personal Loans"}, {"desc": "Working-capital loans for shops and small businesses.", "title": "Business Loans"}], "title": "Loan Types", "subtitle": "Support every product your business offers."}, {"items": [{"desc": "Assign borrowers and areas to specific field agents.", "title": "Agent Assignment"}, {"desc": "Track agent attendance and daily start/end with timestamps.", "title": "Attendance & Check-in"}, {"desc": "See each agent''s targets, collections and recovery rate.", "title": "Performance Tracking"}, {"desc": "Optimised daily routes so agents cover more, faster.", "title": "Route Planning"}, {"desc": "Auto-calculate agent commissions on collected amounts.", "title": "Commission & Incentives"}], "title": "Staff Management", "subtitle": "Run a productive, accountable collection team."}, {"items": [{"desc": "See where every field agent is, in real time, on a map.", "title": "Live Agent Location"}, {"desc": "Each collection is geo-stamped to confirm the agent was on-site.", "title": "Visit Verification"}, {"desc": "Replay an agent''s full day — every stop and distance covered.", "title": "Route History"}, {"desc": "Get alerts when agents move outside their assigned areas.", "title": "Geo-fencing"}], "title": "GPS Tracking", "subtitle": "Know exactly where collections happen."}, {"items": [{"desc": "Daily, weekly and monthly collection summaries at a glance.", "title": "Collection Reports"}, {"desc": "Instantly surface overdue accounts and at-risk loans.", "title": "Overdue & NPA Reports"}, {"desc": "Compare agents on collections, visits and recovery rate.", "title": "Agent Performance"}, {"desc": "Reconcile total cash collected vs deposited, every day.", "title": "Daily Cash Summary"}, {"desc": "Export any report to Excel/PDF for accounting and audits.", "title": "Exports"}], "title": "Reports & Analytics", "subtitle": "Make decisions backed by real-time data."}], "canonical": "", "highlight": "loan collection, simplified", "metaTitle": "Vasool App — Loan Collection & Field-Agent Management Software", "sortOrder": 1, "description": "A complete loan management and field-collection app — track loans, schedule collections, manage agents with live GPS, and see every rupee recovered in real time.", "ogDescription": "Manage loans, field agents, GPS-verified collections, pricing and reports in one app. Book a free demo.", "metaDescription": "Vasool App is loan management and collection software for lenders, NBFCs and chit funds — track loans, schedule collections, manage agents with live GPS, and view recovery reports in real time."}]},"updated_at":"2026-06-17T08:20:25.669+00:00","updated_by":"b3fa86c2-511d-4383-b6ab-07c41ce0e8c8"}]');

